{"ID":"20240118151248-rpc38kb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151248-rpc38kb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151248-rpc38kb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151248-1rkipkq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110000-5ipj8j9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122110000-5ipj8j9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:269,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:269\u0026#125;","title":"103五加皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240130093511"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151248-1rkipkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151248-1rkipkq","updated":"20240122105842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛温，主心腹疝气腹痛，益气疗躄，小儿不能行，疽创阴蚀。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105846-d6dl0p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105846-d6dl0p9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西江浙湖南等地，五叶者良，根皮入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105848-c97gmpb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105848-c97gmpb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105849-qmvruk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105849-qmvruk2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】五加皮为祛风湿壮筋骨要药，主疼痹风弱，五缓虚羸，小儿行迟，疝气腹痛，治瘀留皮肌，阴痒囊湿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105851-ysm3vhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105851-ysm3vhd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】男子阴痿囊下湿，小便余沥，女人阴痒及腰脊痛，两脚疼痹风弱，五缓虚羸，补中益精，坚筋骨，强志意。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105854-0dbdi1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105854-0dbdi1j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】破逐恶风，四肢不遂，贼风伤人，软脚兼腰，主多年瘀血在皮肌，治痹湿内不足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105857-942yfhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105857-942yfhq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】明目下气，治中风骨节挛急。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105858-qnm5ild","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105858-qnm5ild"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏颂】酿酒饮治风痹，四肢挛急。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105900-wc175ge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105900-wc175ge"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【雷斅】作末浸酒饮，治目僻眼瘫。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105901-tn5g3a2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105901-tn5g3a2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105902-3o0oh2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105902-3o0oh2p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】下部无寒湿邪而有火，及肝肾虚而有火，均忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122105842-h7rirtf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122105842-h7rirtf"}},{"ID":"20240122110000-6nvwjn8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110000-6nvwjn8"}},{"ID":"20240122110000-5ipj8j9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122110000-5ipj8j9","updated":"20240130093511"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第103味药，五加皮，这个五加皮被台湾的药厂做成五加皮酒，一样的，它的根、皮入药，散、辛，根皮入药，祛风湿壮筋骨的药，也可以泡酒，性温无毒。如果说你开处方五加皮三钱啊什么都没有关系，那一般来说，如果，不会喝酒的人那五加皮酒不能喝啊，一喝酒醉了，五加皮还没有到关节你就醉了，所以五加皮还是要用，用在皮肤上啊，这个皮类的东西，五加皮都能祛风湿壮筋骨，所以说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阴部的一些湿疹脓疮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们非常多的药都可以治疗阴部的湿疹脓疮，诸位都可以选用它，但是要记得，它的寒热，五加皮呢是性温，温性的药，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般遇到寒症的时候使用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那还有很多像蛇床子去湿热的药，寒药，那你就要用蛇床子，两个是反的，诸如此类。那你泡酒可以啊，泡酒，这个酒鬼可以喝啦。"}]}]}